+// not milliseconds. Timing that out does not cancel anything: the worker keeps booting and goes on to
+// register a room, while the coordinator has already released the slot and told the user the arcade is
+// full. The two then disagree about who is running what. So slow boots get room to finish, and only the
+// calls that genuinely should be instant keep the short leash.
